{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"e85d552a10b249b22f82e7dbfcf718c40e80f73bf48404388d86d5945e700c72","ja":"5人の雑誌企画、スタート！","zh":"5人的杂志企划，启动！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"cafb2265538373bf0f74af59fdc3d52b8b6f755d763f2203aced021103f103c3","ja":"マンガ研究サークルの劇を上演している5人に\n雑誌の短期連載のオファーが舞い込んだ","zh":"正在上演漫研社戏剧的5人\n迎来了杂志短期连载的邀约","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"d15010bf67f230ccad21be6e3e4c3b43e7c343aad9bcf9364f2a239e0c892220","ja":"その名も『フレッシュクリエイト』！\n4回にわたって様々な挑戦をするという企画","zh":"其名就叫“Fresh Create”！\n这是一项分4次进行各种挑战的企划","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"60b04f1dddb300455229a7b4b5b1e5c8e9da071418a259bc327b80112ab30a98","ja":"記念すべき第1回目の挑戦は『学生のファッション\nショーの取材記事を書こう』という内容で……","zh":"值得纪念的第1次挑战内容是“撰写学生时装\n秀的采访报道”……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"6c244d3d8fd22c81dee7161adefaa190ce21592a874e7762f47837b656e4e6e1","ja":"ふおぉ……！\nかわいい衣装がいっぱいです～～～～！","zh":"哇哦……！\n有好多可爱的服装啊～～～～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"959868ccac759d5ae346d4827eeebb4bea70f12df8b00aed85dceb279dce7ed4","ja":"……はっ、つ、つい大声を……。\nみなさん、すみません！","zh":"……啊，我、我不小心喊得太大声了……\n各位，对不起！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"30c6cf7f0e694217ae61d8d420a20eaa38f5b5f0b6ba0a98a33524861ba48b5f","ja":"でも周りの人たち、全然気にしてないみたいだよ。\nファッションショーのことで頭がいっぱいなのかも？","zh":"不过周围的人好像完全不在意呢。\n可能满脑子都是时装秀的事？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"b9d91fdc27957ab55830e48bca494467da814818f65f5f7a3db3d43b84def79f","ja":"確かに……服飾科のみなさん、\nずっと熱心に衣装と向き合っていますね。","zh":"确实……服装设计专业的大家，\n一直都全心全意地投入在服装制作上呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"8e84921a7d2fc3917b8a574d4f5782e3d681d7d69970ac9550f5e71bce92fd6c","ja":"ありさたちも負けてられません！　今日はしっかり\nショーの準備の様子を取材しちゃいましょう！","zh":"亚利沙她们也不能认输！今天就好好\n取材报道一下筹备演出的情况吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"2f471c97d6211b86dda553129ee472d79f5d278b3b808c9481d8a726a7cdc1b0","ja":"うん♪　それじゃあ早速、\n生徒さんにインタビューしよっ♪","zh":"嗯♪　那么事不宜迟，\n去采访一下学生吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"8be2c3aad6f64e362edea374d148ed9ad8cf0729a7d8636fd2dfd5be96f201e1","ja":"すみませーん！　この服の、\n一回り小さいサイズはありませんか～？","zh":"不好意思——！这件衣服\n有小一号的尺寸吗～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"5a60b034fe440a72d72b26ef0c2dcad3a6bd22567a56f77a317360b8973133c5","ja":"れ、麗花ちゃん、ここはブティックでは……。","zh":"丽、丽花，这里好像不是精品店……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c","ja":"数時間後……","zh":"几小时后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"2ae984df3a3e601b9d1b1746d45e525c98fa934e55c51097036724749e149560","ja":"まさか生徒さんたちの衣装のクオリティが\nあんなに高いなんて！　まさしくプロの現場でした！","zh":"真没想到学生们的服装品质\n居然那么高！简直就是专业的现场！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"af91b9360235f440d4dc52e4f5f0bdc2ddeb9f5b1758c82c7bcefba87ef98f1f","ja":"まだ高校生なのにすごいよね～！\nかわいいのも綺麗なのも、いっぱいで。","zh":"明明还是高中生，却好厉害呀～！\n既可爱又漂亮，各种各样应有尽有。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"d2449808f567ac811e1468171bf31d87c8aa7930d8560d7d1d723c5a21bb152c","ja":"はい！　こだわりのつまった衣装ばかりでした！","zh":"是的！每套服装都凝聚了满满的心血！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"a76da19c02504ca148e75b9230d4b44a9327274f55c15d3ab04bebed851cfefe","ja":"ありさと同じくらいの年なのに、あんなに\nステキな衣装が作れるなんて……すごいです！","zh":"明明和亚利沙差不多大，却能做出\n那么棒的服装……太厉害了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"763e402ce80070037ecd7ffa31fb113023690bff2248fd1bd1d78590929cc5e6","ja":"そうだよね♪　衣装の勉強で\nモデルをしてる人なんかもいて。","zh":"是啊♪　还有为了学习服装搭配\n去当模特的人呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"f72ed739252ccf1c641f3ad47ba699a8781d9990633ceba2e17474c8f90999b0","ja":"あ、そういえばさっき、モデルをしてみませんかって\nスカウトされちゃった♪","zh":"啊，说起来刚才有人问我要不要去当模特，\n被星探搭讪了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"9420939e2070a70f012bbfe13cf2c3cf6e179aea46880c0f9d02c1908b350c89","ja":"私とお話してたら、センセーショナルなデザインを\n思いついたんだって♪","zh":"跟我聊着聊着，就想出了\n惊艳四座的设计呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"97540536318291e2766fce6327367a664ee17eea219be2abf43c7abb1ffae6eb","ja":"麗花ちゃんと高校生デザイナーさんの奇跡コラボ！\nふおー！　若き才能のビックバンが起こりそうですっ！","zh":"丽花与高中生设计师的奇迹合作！\n哇——！年轻的才能似乎要引发大爆炸了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"6158df823d5d498dd935e16da61def455ae8c7e435c8d1c23361c32babef6eee","ja":"ふふっ♪\n本当にコラボができたら嬉しいな！","zh":"呵呵♪\n要是真能联动的话就太开心了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"7546b191a6e568803a0a1789c135173ce1f26dc6e3442b45e1261228ed4fdf10","ja":"高校生デザイナーさんのキラキラした目を見てたら、\n私も頑張るぞ～！って感じるし♪","zh":"看着高中生设计师闪闪发光的眼神，\n我也觉得要加把劲啦～！♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1023.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"7ab4341921a93bd19345aab0db2b5194ed41df3532520777049bdb5cff927063","ja":"ありさもですっ！　ショーの本番当日も\nみなさんのこと、しっかり取材しましょう！","zh":"亚利沙也是！公演正式开始当天，\n我也要好好取材大家的一举一动！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
